      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEAR THE CROW (1) has a strong record this track and trip with five wins and four placings from 12 starts. Recorded a 5.5 lengths win (25.20) in a NG last time at this track. Looks suited and should go close. MOST DETERMINED (2) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 450m behind HEAR THE CROW (25.75) in a NG. Was a winner the start prior. Has ability and can measure up. RED ROCK RAZZLE (7) ran below best last time finishing seventh (26.03) over 457m at Q Lakeside from Box 4. Comes out of a hot form race last start. Should be about the money. ISLE OF LACHLAN (5) recorded a half a length win (20.13) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Has already won three times from this draw.",
